ANetRLogin v0.2.5

Outbound RLogin for classic DOS BBS systems.
16-bit DOS/OpenDoors/FOSSIL door + Win32 bridge
and optional ANSI/CP437 local viewer. Supports
10 BBS nodes, 32 destinations, %USER%/%ALIAS%/
%PASSWORD%, low-latency relay, multi-node IPC,
80-column/configurable-width viewer modes, and ESC-ESC-ESC
manual return. Tested with Spitfire/Synchronet.

By: A-Net Online / StingRay
